cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Wheel — a rotational sprocket-chain navigator for deep hierarchies"
abstract: >-
  A mobile-first instrument for navigating large hierarchical and sequential
  datasets by rotating a bounded chain of nodes around an eccentric,
  off-screen hub. The engine is GPL-3.0; the documentation is published but
  reserved, with a standing grant to implement the WILBUR format freely; and
  the corpus is not in this repository. NOTICE states the boundary and is
  authoritative — no single license label describes this work.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Gibbens
    given-names: Howell
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-9904-9864"
    affiliation: "Meccanismi Marittimi delle Marche (MMdM), Fano (PU), Italy"
# No `license:` field, deliberately (H-6). CFF takes a single SPDX identifier
# per record and cannot express mixed rights, so any value here would be a
# blanket claim over material it does not describe — which is the error this
# ruling corrects. Rights live in NOTICE. Citation function (title, authors,
# version, DOI) is unaffected.
repository-code: "https://github.com/mmdm-it/wheel"
url: "https://mmdm.it/"
keywords:
  - human-computer interaction
  - hierarchical navigation
  - radial navigation
  - rotational user interface
  - keyboard-free search
